  "bio": "Nepo Arte is an exceptional tattoo artist based in Mayagüez, Puerto Rico, known for their distinctive illustrative style that translates beautifully in both murals and tattoos at Hari Sumi Tattoo Studio. Their work is not only creatively inspiring, but also highlights an unwavering commitment to cleanliness, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for every client. With Nepo Arte, you can expect a masterpiece inked with utmost precision and care.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Mayagüez, Puerto Rico, Puerto Rico",
